@startuml
title Rholang-Native Virtual Host Bridge
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

rectangle "Rholang caller\nnew ret in { ... }" as Caller #DBEAFE
rectangle "Bridge service name\ntsNode" as Service #FEF3C7
rectangle "Bridge signature\nservice + params + result" as Sig #FEF3C7
rectangle "Source codec\nFLT + args to Canon(T)" as Decode #FDE68A
rectangle "Canonical request\nprogram AST + typed params" as Canon #DCFCE7
rectangle "Target type profile\nruntime representation" as Profile #EDE9FE
rectangle "Virtual runtime\nexecute guest term" as Runtime #CCFBF1
rectangle "Return codec\nprofile result to Par" as ReturnCodec #FDE68A
rectangle "Return channel\nret" as Ret #DBEAFE
rectangle "Rholang continuation\nfor (@(ok,payload) <- ret)" as Cont #DBEAFE
rectangle "BridgeError\nordinary value" as Error #FEE2E2

Caller --> Service : tsNode!(*ret, FLT, args)
Service --> Sig : lookup bridge contract
Sig --> Decode : choose codecs
Decode --> Canon : decode and validate
Decode -[#DC2626,dashed]-> Error : invalid request
Canon --> Profile : select representation
Profile --> Runtime : encode and evaluate
Profile -[#DC2626,dashed]-> Error : unsupported policy
Runtime --> ReturnCodec : result or runtime error
ReturnCodec --> Ret : ret!((true, value))
Error -[#DC2626,dashed]-> Ret : ret!((false, error))
ReturnCodec -[#DC2626,dashed]-> Ret : ret!((false, error))
Ret --> Cont : ordinary receive

legend right
  |= Color |= Concept |
  |<#DBEAFE> | Rholang process/channel |
  |<#FEF3C7> | Bridge service contract |
  |<#FDE68A> | Codecs and validation |
  |<#DCFCE7> | Canonical request |
  |<#EDE9FE> | Runtime profile |
  |<#CCFBF1> | Virtual runtime |
  |<#FEE2E2> | Deterministic error value |
endlegend
@enduml
